			"date": "2023-10-12T17:19:49.243Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a class=\"u-url mention\" href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> same, but I think we underestimate the scale of “social feeds” in contrast to dorks like us who use RSS readers.</p>",
