				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.masto.host/fediversezachleatcom/cache/accounts/avatars/109/761/382/572/276/052/original/21fc353630fe9913.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2023-10-12T17:36:09.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I wonder if more people use RSS readers or ActivityPub clients. But also, RSS is an inbox and following a blog here could be more casual and serendipitous and allow easy boosting.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
