			"date": "2023-10-12T17:57:22.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <br>I'll probably stick with RSS but for people who like to boost interesting posts, this makes it easier and the feature to display fedi replies as blog comments sounds appealing.</p>",
